# Generated archives and installers are ignored by default.
# The three intentional public release artifacts below remain allowed.
*.whl
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
!dist/tardisha-23.0.7-*.whl
!dist/tardisha-23.0.7.tar.gz
!dist/tardisha_23.0.7-1_amd64.deb

# Generated manifests/checksums outside the public root
**/SHA256SUMS.txt
**/SOURCE_MANIFEST.json
!SHA256SUMS.txt
SOURCE_MANIFEST.json
CHANGELOG.md
PUBLICATION_CHECKLIST.md
SOURCE_MANIFEST.json
RELEASE_CONTENTS.md

